    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
